## Code Quality Setup

### ESLint Configuration
Flat config in [eslint.config.mjs](mdc:eslint.config.mjs), spreading `eslint-config-next/core-web-vitals` (ESLint 9+).

### Prettier Configuration
Automatic formatting on commit via lint-staged:
```json
{
  "lint-staged": {
    "**/*": "prettier --write --ignore-unknown"
  }
}
```

### Commit Convention
Using conventional commit format via [commitlint.config.js](mdc:commitlint.config.js):
- `feat:` - New features
- `fix:` - Bug fixes
- `docs:` - Documentation changes
- `style:` - Code style changes
- `refactor:` - Code refactoring
- `test:` - Test changes
- `chore:` - Build/tooling changes

## Environment Configuration

### Environment Variables
Create `.env.local` for local development:
```env
# API Configuration
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:3000
API_SECRET_KEY=your-secret-key

# Authentication
NEXTAUTH_URL=http://localhost:3000
NEXTAUTH_SECRET=your-nextauth-secret

# Database
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@localhost:5432/conduit

# External Services
SMTP_HOST=smtp.example.com
SMTP_PORT=587
SMTP_USER=your-email@example.com
SMTP_PASS=your-password
```

### Environment Management
The application supports multiple environments through [src/lib/logic/EnvManager.ts](mdc:src/lib/logic/EnvManager.ts):
- Local development
- Staging
- Production
- Custom environments

## Docker Development

### Dockerfile Setup
See the repo [Dockerfile](mdc:Dockerfile) for the current multi-stage build (`node:24-alpine`, `next.config.ts`, standalone output).

### Docker Development Commands
```bash
# Build for production deployment
docker build --platform linux/amd64 -t conduit-ui:latest .

# Run locally
